message: "If you use or refer to this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Field Studio: a mesh-free implicit-field sculpting tool, with its research record"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Birchard"
    given-names: "Mathew"
    affiliation: "DCV Systems, LLC"
version: "0.2.0-research"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/dirtcodevet/field-studio"
abstract: "A mesh-free sculpting, simulation and rendering tool in which every form is an implicit field on a sparse, multi-level lattice. This release adds the tool's source code (Apache-2.0) and a measured status review to the dated research record of the first release (documents and images under CC BY 4.0)."
keywords:
  - implicit surfaces
  - signed distance fields
  - digital sculpting
  - contact simulation
  - rendering
  - procedural generation
  - material modelling
